                                                "sense_id": "da01ed38-f76e-3617-8b76-4e02e635f9e4",
                                                "text": "Yongin, a city of about a million people south of Seoul, the capital, has been in talks with the central government about financial support for businesses near the Ramada, Mayor Baek Gun-gi said at a news conference on Tuesday."
