                                                "sense_id": "da01ed38-f76e-3617-8b76-4e02e635f9e4",
                                                "text": "Samsung Electronics is set to invest 500 trillion won ($375 billion) in the project, allocating 360 trillion won for six new production facilities in Yongin, located 33 kilometers (20 miles) south of Seoul."
